<div class="feature-item" style="padding:10px 14px;background:rgba(201,169,97,0.18);color:#0e2b44;font-weight:700"><span>👤</span><span>人脸验证</span></div>
<div class="feature-item" style="padding:10px 14px;background:rgba(201,169,97,0.18);color:#0e2b44;font-weight:700"><span>🔒</span><span>安全可靠</span></div>
<div class="feature-item" style="padding:10px 14px;background:rgba(201,169,97,0.18);color:#0e2b44;font-weight:700"><span>⚡</span><span>3分钟完成</span></div>
